{%- comment -%}
  Designed "Shipping & Delivery" page body (handle: shipping). Image-free by design.
  Ported 1:1 from docs/mockups/page-shipping.html; styling = .kv-cp.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="kv-cp">

  <section class="phead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Shipping &amp; Delivery</span>
      <h1>Quickly, safely, exactly as promised.</h1>
      <p>We want your Kordovan order to reach you fast and arrive perfect. Here's everything you need to know before you buy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec--tight"><div class="wrap"><div class="strip">
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Free delivery over PKR 2,500</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>Cash on delivery nationwide</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>Dispatched in 1–2 days</span>
    <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.7l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.7l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0"/><path d="m7.5 4.2 9 5.2"/></svg>Tracked door to door</span>
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--tight"><div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">Delivery Times &amp; Charges</span><h2>Where it goes, and when.</h2></div>
    <table class="tbl">
      <tr><th>Destination</th><th>Estimated delivery</th><th>Charge</th></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad</b></td><td>2–4 business days</td><td>Free over PKR 2,500</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>All other cities</b></td><td>3–6 business days</td><td>Free over PKR 2,500</td></tr>
      <tr><td><b>Orders under PKR 2,500</b></td><td>Same timeframes</td><td>Flat fee shown at checkout</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:20px;color:var(--stone);font-size:14px">Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days. Timeframes exclude Sundays &amp; public holidays.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--tight"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr">
    <div class="card">
      <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
      <h3>Cash on Delivery</h3>
      <p>Pay in cash when your order arrives at your doorstep — available nationwide, with no advance payment required. Prefer to pay online? Card, Easypaisa and JazzCash are all accepted at checkout.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.7l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.7l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16"/><path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5M12 22V12"/></svg>
      <h3>Order Tracking</h3>
      <p>Once your order ships, you'll receive a tracking number by SMS or email so you can follow your parcel every step of the way — right to your door.</p>
    </div>
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--parch"><div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">Good to Know</span><h2>Shipping questions, answered.</h2></div>
    <div class="acc">
      <details open><summary>When will my order be dispatched?</summary><p>Orders are typically packed and dispatched within 1–2 business days. You'll get a tracking number as soon as it leaves us.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you ship internationally?</summary><p>Our standard delivery covers all of Pakistan. For international orders, message us on WhatsApp and we'll arrange a quote.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I'm not home for delivery?</summary><p>The courier will attempt delivery and call you to reschedule. You can also coordinate a convenient time directly with them using your tracking details.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I change my delivery address after ordering?</summary><p>If your order hasn't shipped yet, contact us on WhatsApp with your order number and we'll update it right away.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--tight"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact">
    <div>
      <h3>Still have a question?</h3>
      <p>Our team is here Monday–Saturday, 12 PM – 10 PM.<br>WhatsApp +92 333 2601161 · kordovan.official@gmail.com</p>
    </div>
    <a class="fwa" href="https://wa.me/923332601161" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.5 15.3L2 22l4.8-1.5A10 10 0 1 0 12 2z" fill="#fff"/></svg>Chat on WhatsApp</a>
  </div></div></section>

</div>
